#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Discover how quantum and high-performance computing can be combined in a single workflow."
msgstr "Temukan bagaimana komputasi kuantum dan komputasi berkinerja tinggi dapat digabungkan dalam satu alur kerja."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Ikhtisar"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Ikhtisar {#overview}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/index/hero.avif)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/index/hero.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course provides an overview of classical and quantum resources as well hybrid workflows with examples.\n"
msgstr "Kursus ini memberikan ikhtisar tentang sumber daya klasik dan kuantum serta alur kerja hybrid dengan contoh-contoh.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Latar belakang yang direkomendasikan {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course is intended for two distinct groups of individuals: those with backgrounds in quantum computing but not in HPC, and those with backgrounds in HPC but not quantum computing. These technologies complement each other, and those with expertise in one are increasingly aware of the importance of the other. Learners can skip over sections in their own area of expertise as appropriate.\n"
msgstr "Kursus ini ditujukan untuk dua kelompok orang yang berbeda: mereka yang memiliki latar belakang dalam komputasi kuantum tetapi tidak dalam HPC, dan mereka yang memiliki latar belakang dalam HPC tetapi tidak dalam komputasi kuantum. Teknologi-teknologi ini saling melengkapi, dan mereka yang memiliki keahlian di salah satu bidang semakin menyadari pentingnya bidang lainnya. Peserta didik bisa melewati bagian dalam area keahlian mereka sendiri sesuai kebutuhan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We recommend that learners complete the following prerequisite prior to this course:\n"
msgstr "Kami merekomendasikan agar peserta didik menyelesaikan prasyarat berikut sebelum kursus ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up your local environment by following along with the [Get started](/guides/) guide in our documentation page.\n"
msgstr "Siapkan lingkungan lokalmu dengan mengikuti panduan [Mulai](/guides/) di halaman dokumentasi kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For a deeper understanding of quantum information, complete this optional course:\n"
"- [Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) with John Watrous.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk pemahaman yang lebih mendalam tentang informasi kuantum, selesaikan kursus opsional ini:\n"
"- [Dasar-dasar informasi kuantum](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) bersama John Watrous.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Ujian {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for Integrating Quantum and High-Performance Computing, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mendapatkan lencana untuk Integrating Quantum and High-Performance Computing, ikuti ujian di IBM&reg; Training. Ujian ini dimaksudkan untuk diikuti setelah membaca pelajaran-pelajaran dalam kursus ini. Setelah kamu lulus ujian, kamu akan diberi tahu oleh Credly bahwa kamu telah memperoleh sebuah lencana.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/exam)\n"
msgstr "[Ujian](/learning/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/exam)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Awarded Badge {#awarded-badge}"
msgstr "Lencana yang Diberikan {#awarded-badge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Image of the awarded badge\"](/learning/images/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/exam/badge.svg)\n"
msgstr "![\"Image of the awarded badge\"](/learning/images/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/exam/badge.svg)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credly {#credly}"
msgstr "Credly {#credly}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/). IBM employees can view the IBM Internal Privacy Statement [here](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice).\n"
msgstr "PEMBERITAHUAN: IBM memanfaatkan layanan Credly, pemroses data pihak ketiga yang diotorisasi oleh IBM dan berlokasi di Amerika Serikat, untuk membantu administrasi program IBM Digital Badge. Untuk menerbitkan IBM Digital Badge kamu, informasi pribadimu (nama, alamat email, dan lencana yang diperoleh) akan dibagikan dengan Credly. Kamu akan menerima notifikasi email dari Credly dengan petunjuk untuk mengklaim lencana. Informasi pribadimu digunakan untuk menerbitkan lencanamu dan untuk pelaporan program serta tujuan operasional. IBM dapat membagikan informasi pribadi yang dikumpulkan dengan anak perusahaan dan pihak ketiga IBM secara global. Informasi tersebut akan ditangani secara konsisten dengan praktik privasi IBM. Pernyataan Privasi IBM bisa dilihat [di sini.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/) Karyawan IBM bisa melihat Pernyataan Privasi Internal IBM [di sini.](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice)\n"
